# Route: guide 35 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 55 to
# 56, 16 quests, 1.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Tirisfal Glades, Duskwood, Burning Steppes, Searing Gorge): The
# Bulwark -> Darkshire -> Ruins of Thaurissan -> Grimesilt Dig Site.
